  <note><content>
    <p>The pure arm contained only variant RCS, its difference from the matched wild-type control, and the absolute difference, with no position, position interaction, codon or amino-acid identity, GC, local-MFE, or other intrinsic feature; the frozen 131-construct train-plus-development artifact reused five outer folds, four inner folds, three seeds, and six alphas for 375 new fits, while all 33 test constructs remained excluded.</p>
    <p>Primary-seed metrics were intrinsic RMSE 0.03413327461240379, MAE 0.022187896273263757, Spearman 0.6123990835404937; pure external RCS RMSE 0.04929761172417739, MAE 0.03158281646008941, Spearman -0.13201530863899236; intrinsic+RCS RMSE 0.034152773868486606, MAE 0.021816612746170472, Spearman 0.6163526287671603; and full mechanism RMSE 0.03422820302559988, MAE 0.0222595186439585, Spearman 0.6352981456298568.</p>
    <p>For pure minus intrinsic, Spearman delta was -0.744414392179486 with CI [-0.9403491867053566, -0.5300791533185797] and Holm p=0.0002999850007499625, while RMSE delta was 0.015164337111773597 with CI [0.005846359530413134, 0.02506527402042598] and Holm p=0.009449527523623819; for full minus pure, the corresponding values were 0.7673134542688491, CI [0.5631894046071572, 0.9532654793818945], Holm p=0.0002999850007499625, and -0.015069408698577508, CI [-0.02544806838533774, -0.005479110034720501], Holm p=0.009449527523623819; for intrinsic+RCS minus pure, they were 0.7483679374061527, CI [0.539343123375721, 0.9432946055506556], Holm p=0.0002999850007499625, and -0.015144837855690783, CI [-0.02536403898497323, -0.00577083989049933], Holm p=0.009449527523623819.</p>
    <p>Both sensitivity seeds retained the adverse pure-minus-intrinsic directions, the old full-minus-intrinsic comparison remained non-significant with both Holm p=1 and both CIs crossing zero, and development-only wins over pure RCS do not establish a mechanism increment; independent verification passed 174/174 with maximum numeric delta 0, finalization passed 43/43, postpush independent verification passed 174/174, manuscript v32 section 6.28 and GitHub commits b95e1244537a23c95cdda986cb60e343cfd7e4da and d5959f73ac4f4812d614eee6d6c04d320dff38fc record the evidence, while replacement, mechanism increment, RK-G1, test authorization, and generator authorization remain false.</p>
  </content></note>
